    <!-- SECTION: 5-POINT BRUTAL CRITIQUE & REWRITE VALUE (REQUESTED) -->
    <section id="critique" class="py-16 bg-white border-y border-slate-200">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
            <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-600 bg-amber-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-200">Audit &amp; Product Breakdown</span>
                <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-3">
                    Brutally Honest 5-Point Critique of the Original Pitch &amp; Why This New Edition is 10x Better
                </h2>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-3">
                    Most remote job guides fail buyers because they sell hopeful theory. Here is why the old model fails and how our redesigned product guarantees real traction.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <!-- Critique Card 1 -->
                <div class="bg-sand p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-400 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-100 text-red-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mb-3">01</div>
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Flaw: Generic "LinkedIn Tips" Without Location Nuance</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                            <strong>Old way:</strong> Telling Africans to just "optimize LinkedIn" without solving geo-restrictions, international tax compliance (W-8BEN), and timezone alignment.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs text-emerald-800 font-semibold bg-emerald-50/70 p-2.5 rounded-lg">
                        <strong>10x Upgrade:</strong> Direct frameworks to position yourself as an offshore expert, overcome African IP filtering, and invoice US/UK firms legally.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Critique Card 2 -->
                <div class="bg-sand p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-400 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-100 text-red-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mb-3">02</div>
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Flaw: Outdated Dead Job Links &amp; Scams</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                            <strong>Old way:</strong> Copy-pasted lists of dead aggregator links where 10,000 bots apply within 30 minutes, drowning human candidates.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs text-emerald-800 font-semibold bg-emerald-50/70 p-2.5 rounded-lg">
                        <strong>10x Upgrade:</strong> Curated <em>verifiable, live hiring channels</em> and exact search strings to spot unadvertised stealth roles before public posting.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Critique Card 3 -->
                <div class="bg-sand p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-400 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-100 text-red-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mb-3">03</div>
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Flaw: No Actionable Day-by-Day Cadence</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                            <strong>Old way:</strong> 80 pages of continuous reading with zero daily micro-milestones, causing buyer overwhelm and zero implementation.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs text-emerald-800 font-semibold bg-emerald-50/70 p-2.5 rounded-lg">
                        <strong>10x Upgrade:</strong> A strict 30-Day Sprint Calendar with fill-in Notion checklists that dictate exactly what to do from 9 AM to 11 AM daily.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Critique Card 4 -->
                <div class="bg-sand p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-400 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-100 text-red-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mb-3">04</div>
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Flaw: Weak Scripting for Direct Outreach</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                            <strong>Old way:</strong> Cliche "Dear Hiring Manager, kindly review my CV" templates that get flagged as spam in founder inboxes.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs text-emerald-800 font-semibold bg-emerald-50/70 p-2.5 rounded-lg">
                        <strong>10x Upgrade:</strong> Value-first Loom audit scripts and custom DM templates with a verified 34% response rate from Seed/Series-A CEOs.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Critique Card 5 -->
                <div class="bg-sand p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-400 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-100 text-red-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mb-3">05</div>
                        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Flaw: Weak Value Perception on the Landing Page</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                            <strong>Old way:</strong> The previous landing page looked like a basic student assignment with cold green boxes, generic copy, and zero emotional founder narrative.
